00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.650
WELCOME TO
TROPICAL PARADISE
W... wait! Why me?!
Go on! I said go!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:45.850
Oh, wow! You're so gentle.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.260
Cut it out, you jerk!
Oh, wow! You're so gentle.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.060
Cut it out, you jerk!
It's sublime!

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:49.580
I told ya so.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:51.820
Wha- guys?! Why are you here?!

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.660
Well, we came...

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:55.060
...to save you.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.530
Why do you sound so unmotivated?!

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:58.560
Upsy daisy!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.200
I won't let you interfere! Humph!

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:02.570
Huh?

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:09.240
What's this? Is it supposed to slow us down?

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:11.470
Chie!

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:13.650
Are you okay?

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:14.880
What're you doing?

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.020
What is this?! It's slimy!

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:17.820
It's so gross!

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.450
I can't get up.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:21.850
Narukami, got a video camera handy?

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.190
Damn. No!

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.490
What do you think- whoa!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.320
Bastard!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.760
Why don't you stop with the lies?

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:29.690
Huh?!

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:33.300
What's wrong with stating what you want to do?

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:36.030
I'm everything you want to do.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.240
Not true!

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.640
No, don't listen!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:39.440
Jirai- whoa!

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.000
Hanamura!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:45.110
Master, I'll help- Oh, bear!

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:47.270
I hate women.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:54.290
Whenever I sew or draw, they rudely say,
"You're gross" or " But you're a guy."

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.820
Punk, if you don't shuddup...

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.160
"But you're a man! You're a man! You're a man!"

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.420
What's it mean to be manly?

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.030
Aren't women scary?

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:10.970
Th... they don't scare me!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.700
I prefer men!

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:15.040
They don't say, "But you're a man."

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.270
That's why I prefer men!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.380
Not true!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.680
But it is.

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:22.440
You are me and I am you.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.280
Like Hell you are...

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.350
No! Don't say it, Kanji!

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:29.290
There's no freakin' way you're me!

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.860
I am you! I'm you!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:41.370
I am a Shadow, the true self...

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:43.610
Oh, my, my, my!

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:45.660
That's enough shit outta you!

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:48.770
Don't interfere!

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:50.480
Kanji!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.350
Are you okay?!
Kanji!

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.470
Hang in there!

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:55.640
I want to be honest with myself.

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:58.650
And I'll get rid of anyone who gets in my way.

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.620
I can't believe this is how Kanji truly feels...

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.260
This isn't how he feels!

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.250
His emotions are just going haywire.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:04.460
Get him!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:05.260
BURNING
UP!
Get him!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.160
Oh, yeah!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.170
Hey! Come on, baby!

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.360
Wh... what gives?!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:18.140
Oh, nice!

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:19.330
No way!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.880
What's going on?

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:24.370
Hey, Kuma! What's the big deal?
We've got some weirdoes here!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.840
They're probably beary much
a part of Kanji's Shadow.

00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:30.920
My, what a stud!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.150
Ch... change!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:34.820
H... huh?

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:40.620
Hmm?

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.560
Hold me tight!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.700
Ch... cha-

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:49.770
I could eat you up!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:51.600
You, too!

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:53.780
I'm dead...

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.940
He's toxic! He broke their spirit!

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.350
Crap! The guys are down!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.980
It's okay. They aren't interested in us, I think...

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:03.940
Humph!

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:06.950
Eh? Wh... what is it?

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.720
Mismatching red!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.120
What?!

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:14.390
Feels so good!

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.390
C... calm down, Yukiko!

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:21.530
Wh... what is it?

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.840
Say something!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:31.800
Feeling so good!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:35.350
G... guys, cool down!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.750
They weren't any trouble at all.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.790
What a hoot!

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:50.460
You sound lovely! It's making my heart race.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:51.430
Hm?

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:55.000
But you're an eyesore!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.740
You're...

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:13.380
Well, now for our last hustle time!

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:19.490
At this rate...

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:22.890
I've been waiting for you.

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:27.660
The time has finally come.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:31.070
It is time for you to awaken
your Wild Card's true power.

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:57.900
Awesome!

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:58.830
They merged together!

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.500
Oh, my God!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.070
I don't dislike this! Not at all!

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:06.700
Ecstasy!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.170
Oh, no!

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:12.340
I'm so cold!

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.210
Isn't that?

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.480
Didn't you make it?

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.990
What? Got a problem with that?

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:23.320
I made it even though I'm a dude...

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.420
No, I think it's cute.

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:26.320
Huh?

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:28.120
It's cute.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.430
Cu-?!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.420
It-it-it-it's cute?!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:36.490
It's super-duper cute! I love anything cute!

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:45.870
You're so persistent!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.810
Yeah, that's right.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:49.250
What is?

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:53.480
I love cute shit!

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:55.590
Umph!

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:01.590
Accept me!

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:05.260
He defeated his own Shadow!

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:14.710
Uh, it made me happy when
you called it cute and accepted me.

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:22.210
He... he's come back for more!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.880
You must really find him unbearable!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.520
Someone, anyone, accept me!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:31.090
Accept me!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.880
I said to cut that crap!

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:39.630
Damn, the mere thought that
this is inside of me is disgraceful.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.760
Kanji...

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.440
It ain't about men or women.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.100
I'm just scared shitless of getting rejected.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:49.430
I'm a bloody chicken who tries
to push people away!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.010
So I already knew...

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:58.150
That you're me and I'm you, ya damn idiot!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.180
Mm-hmm.

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:09.790
That's Kanji's Persona.

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:11.730
It's pretty masculine!

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:21.300
Persona...

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:23.210
You okay, Kanji?!

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:24.080
Are you okay?

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:24.640
Kanji!
Are you okay?

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:44.200
Really, guys and girls would get creeped out
if they knew you made this.

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:48.870
Drop it! I'm over that already!

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:49.930
Right.

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:51.570
I owe you.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:53.570
I'm surprised you're being so polite.

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:56.210
Well, you are my senpai.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:22:01.020
More importantly, who was the jackass
that threw me into the TV?

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.480
That's what we're looking into.

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:08.720
Hunting for the culprit? May I help out with that?

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:11.560
I've gotta pay him back ten times over!

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:15.030
For real? That's great! You'll be a huge help.

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:17.160
Yeah! Is that okay, Narukami?

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:18.430
Of course.

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:19.430
Thanks!

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:22.560
I, Kanji Tatsumi, will risk my life for you!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:23.570
no time to waste

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:24.170
but make you pace

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:26.070
it's OK to remove copy and paste

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:27.040
I'm doing my way

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:27.940
you do it your way

