but I'm the epitome of new types

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:34.720
having the fear is power to my soul

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:35.720
cuz I overcome them

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:36.420
that's how I roll

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:38.120
expose your thoughts

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.620
don't be afraid of making mistakes

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:44.150
rules prevailing in

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:48.830
that may be your greatest rival

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:53.770
believe in faith and your heart

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:56.900
your true soul stop being

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:59.510
in the shades come on

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:02.910
out in the open sun

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:08.950
Beauty of the child of destiny

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:12.390
delightful days

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:17.460
are with rich density of love

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:19.120
thorny path

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:24.320
there's no easy way for real bliss

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:27.500
so I keep on fighting for

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:32.270
beauty of destiny

00:23:40.150 --> 00:23:42.380
Adachi was telling me

00:23:42.380 --> 00:23:45.550
that you were out by Tatsumi Textiles.

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:47.520
What were you doing?

00:23:47.520 --> 00:23:49.460
