00:23:58.130 --> 00:24:00.430
No, we're just talking.

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:01.300
Really?

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:01.940
Yeah.
Really?

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:02.470
Yeah.
This is really good!

00:24:02.470 --> 00:24:03.030
This is really good!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:21.190
Tada! It's our new early summer release!

00:24:21.190 --> 00:24:24.030
Senpai, didn't you accept me?

00:24:24.030 --> 00:24:24.760
Not at night.

00:24:24.760 --> 00:24:26.090
